        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--processing-file\">\n\u003csection class=\"processing-file\" aria-label=\"파일 정보\">\n      \u003csvg class=\"processing-file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        \u003cpath d=\"M 7 2 H 21 L 29 10 V 36 A 2 2 0 0 1 27 38 H 7 A 2 2 0 0 1 5 36 V 4 A 2 2 0 0 1 7 2 Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\u003c/path>\n        \u003cpath d=\"M 21 2 V 10 H 29 M 11 19 H 23 M 11 25 H 23 M 11 31 H 19\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\u003c/path>\n      \u003c/svg>\n      \u003cp class=\"processing-file-name\">환경측정결과.xlsx\u003c/p>\n      \u003cspan class=\"processing-file-size\">1.2 MB\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/section>\n\u003c/div>",
